    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Add Reveal Interaction\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Add a button to each card that reveals more information about that specific item without reloading the page.\r\n\r\nUpdate your card template so each card includes a reveal button, such as `See More`, `Reveal`, or another label that fits your app.\r\n\r\nChoose how your reveal will work:\r\n\r\n- **Toggle Method:** Show and hide a hidden section inside the card.\r\n- **Fetch Method:** Request extra detail data for that item and display it inside the card.\r\n\r\nWrite code that:\r\n\r\n- creates a detail area inside each card\r\n- attaches an event listener to each reveal button after the cards render\r\n- identifies which card was clicked using an id, index, or data attribute\r\n- updates only the selected card\r\n\r\nTest your interaction by clicking different cards. Confirm that each button reveals the correct details for the correct item.",
